    {
      "source": "Invoked after the WebSocket connection has been closed by either side, or after a\ntransport error has occurred.",
      "translation": "在 WebSocket 连接被任一方关闭或发生传输错误后调用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after the WebSocket connection has been closed by either side, or after a\ntransport error has occurred. Although the session may technically still be open,\ndepending on the underlying implementation, sending messages at this point is\ndiscouraged and most likely will not succeed.",
      "translation": "在 WebSocket 连接被任一方关闭或发生传输错误后调用。尽管会话在技术上可能仍然处于打开状态，但具体取决于底层实现，此时发送消息是不建议的，并且很可能无法成功。",
      "count": 1
    },
